---
description: >-
  Reverse-position central connection (circle at the source only, `()->>`)
  applied to the "normal" arrow family (solid, dotted, open, cross, close),
  with Alice as sender (LTR) -- part of a matched LTR/RTL pair.
config:
  sequence:
    diagramMarginX: 50
    diagramMarginY: 10
---
%%{init: {'theme':'base'}}%%
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Alice
  participant Bob
  participant Charlie
  Alice()->>Bob: Circle at source with solid arrow
  Alice()-->>Bob: Circle at source with dotted arrow
  Alice()->Bob: Circle at source with open arrow
  Alice()--xBob: Circle at source with cross arrow
  Alice()--)Bob: Circle at source with close arrow
